{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55944","headline":"颂 · 守安","name":"颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南台静坐一鑪香，亘（一作「终」）日凝然万事忘（一作「虑亡」）。\n不是息心除忘想，都缘无事可思量。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十四，注一作者爲《五灯会元》卷八之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"守安","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}